# Rebuilt products and local environments
.venv*/
.local/
**/.runtime/
**/runtime_deps/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
/outputs/
/information_extract/outputs/
/data/derived/
/data/processed/
*.log
.env
.env.*
!*.example
~$*

